msgid "submit job web"
msgstr "submit job web"

#: ../../docs/jobs/slurm-web.rst:21 049d995f35cb499b8a548626a1d3d3d9
msgid "选择需要使用的集群和作业模板，填写作业名称，在脚本编辑器里填入作业脚本，点击右上方的“提交作业”按钮。"
msgstr ""
"Choose the cluster and job template you want to use, fill in the job name, "
"fill in the job script in the script editor, and click the \"submit job\" "
"button in the upper right corner"

#: ../../docs/jobs/slurm-web.rst:23 eb4cb45c18a94bfa805299d49c952e1f
